James Rising received an email from Bornali Mondal, who is seeking guidance on pursuing a PhD in Environmental Economics under his supervision. Bornali is facing financial hardships and requests recommendations for fellowship programs, including a specific inquiry about the Faculty for the Future Fellowship. In response, Arachne drafted a professional email indicating that James has decided not to take on any new students this year, thus rendering securing funding irrelevant. The response encourages Bornali to explore other supervisors and programs while expressing willingness to offer further support if needed.
